  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multisectoral health, nutrition, WASH response to malnutrition and food insecurity in Taiz, Hajjah and Hodeidah</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide health, nutrition and WASH assistance to people affected by food insecurity in Hajjah, Al Hodeida and Taiz governorates. This UNICEF project provides humanitarian assistance to 231,401 people, including 36,868 women, 19,600 men, 174,933 children, and including 21,181 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
